('3aeb735f-438c-4f0e-b874-458afa1f0b40', 'https://www.linkedin.com/sales/lead/ACwAAArY-BgBCVfie3MEszbPZ2y6RiFfaYhcQUI,NAME_SEARCH,QPF_', 'Julien', 'CLEMENT', 'Global Head of Design Digital', 'France', 'Carrefour', '3046', (SELECT id FROM entreprises WHERE company_id_linkedin = '3046' LIMIT 1), 2, 7, 2, 7, 'ACwAAArY-BgBCVfie3MEszbPZ2y6RiFfaYhcQUI', 'Leading Carrefour''s global digital design and customer experience strategy, I manage cross-functional teams across 8 countries. My journey began in marketing, where I discovered a passion for design, self-teaching my way to expertise. At ManoMano, I enhanced brand and user experience, directing a design team in diverse markets.

Previously at Veepee, I led the brand and user experience for France and six other countries with an 80-person team. My approach combines design innovation with business goals, driving complex projects and interdepartmental collaboration.

Passionate about creating optimal design organizations, I focus on developing company visions through design-oriented solutions and fostering adoption through effective collaboration. My background in leading strategic UX-UI projects and working with high-profile clients like Piaget and Coca-Cola demonstrates a unique blend of creative vision and strategic execution.', 'As the current leader of the global digital design and customer experience (CX) strategy at Carrefour, I am responsible for overseeing and directing the development and execution of our design vision. My role involves managing a talented team of 40 professionals, including lead designers, CX researchers, UX writers, and UI designers. This team is distributed across eight digital factories in France and the G8 countries (France, Belgium, Spain, Italy, Brazil, Argentina, Romania, Poland).

My responsibilities extend to animating and setting the international design guidelines, ensuring design coherence and excellence across all our operations. I am tasked with developing and implementing the design strategy, team evolution, and our Design System. This system is a crucial component for harmonizing, creating velocity, and optimizing our processes and digital products, both in front-end and back-end.

Critical role in making strategic decisions regarding design, customer experience, as well as managing the budget and tools of the team. My primary objective is to align design initiatives with Carrefour''s overall business goals, ensuring that every aspect of the user experience strengthens our brand and enhances customer satisfaction.

